  "details": "A VRC Station option to lock a desktop player's mouse look to be vertical only while on a particular station. \n\nThis would allow a station to control the horizontal rotation of the player without having the avatar be moving about with the mouse, and looking at their shoulders at the ends of the 180 deg range. This opens the floor for Udon controlled movement via mouse or other input that doesn't effect how the avatar appears to look horizontally.",
